OL,3,GNEWSAQuarry owner moves onto site after
OL,4,Awaste dumping
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe owner of a quarry in West Yorkshire
OL,7,Fthat is being investigated for
OL,8,Fsuspected illegal waste dumping has
OL,9,Fsaid he has moved onto the site to
OL,10,Fprevent any disposals.
OL,12,FFrank Spencer, owner of Calder Quarry
OL,13,Fin Elland, said he had a stroke at the
OL,14,Fend of last year and was "completely
OL,15,Funaware" of illegal dumping at the
OL,16,Fsite. He said the area had now been
OL,17,Fcleared.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
