OL,3,GNEWSAQuarry owner moves onto site after
OL,4,Awaste dumping
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Environment Agency (EA) began
OL,7,Finvestigating the Calderdale quarry
OL,8,Flast year and obtained a court order to
OL,9,Fblock access to the site earlier this
OL,10,Fmonth.
OL,12,FThe EA said it was "stepping up" its
OL,13,Faction on waste crime and anyone
OL,14,Fbreaching the restriction order was
OL,15,Fcommitting a criminal offence.
